silm:instances_papers_04_forge_sections_09_manifest_hom_profile_concrete_anchor_2#mittensyonedaprofile silm:hasLongDescription "The MittensYonedaProfile is In section 'Manifest as Written Hom-Profile' the bare symbol Outgoing anchors to MittensYonedaProfile: The Yoneda profile of Mittens: the family of Hom(-, Mittens) and Hom(Mittens, -) sets describing all typed approaches to and departures from Mittens — a representable functor." .
